      "author_handle": "BF_Quest",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 13 years 6 months ago",
      "body": "I had a very challenging experience with my first breastfeeding. Now thinking about second baby. Is there a chance that my breastfeeding will be smooth and issue-free?",
