      "post_id": "85500",
      "author_handle": "Sarahwill",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 11 years 9 months ago",
      "body": "I dont have a clear understanding, But it may differ i hope, Since my sister has a smooth breast feeding for her first baby and she has some complexities breast feeding her second baby.\nLets hope for the best . I wish it should be free and healthy for you. Good luck",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9629/#85500",
